  "decision_conditions": [
    "<table style=\"border:undefined; margin-bottom:5px; width:100%\" class=\" cke_show_border\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:12%\"><span style=\"line-height:1\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"vertical-align:top\"></span></span></span></td><td style=\"width:88%\"><p><span style=\"line-height:1\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"vertical-align:top\"><span arial=\"\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt; line-height:115%\">The site is located within 400 metres of a school and it has not been demonstrated that the proposed use of the premises as a hot food takeaway would not have a harmful effect on the health of school-aged children in conflict with Policy E9 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy TC.38 of the Adopted Local Plan (2024)</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:Aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:\r\nminor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;In the absence of an odour risk assessment and\r\nnoise assessment, the applicant has failed to demonstrate that the proposed\r\nextraction flue would not result in harm to neighbouring occupiers by way of\r\nnoise and odour disturbance, contrary to Policy D12.3 of the Local Plan 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
